tamination of environments, and a system therefor, the method comprising releasing an air bag deploying gas from an unused gas generator (X) by applying a YAG laser beam (R) to an igniter (P) of the gas generator (X).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé et un système d'élimination d'un générateur de gaz pouvant éliminer de grandes quantités de générateurs de gaz de manière sûre, efficace et sans pollution pour l'environnement. Le procédé consiste à lâcher un coussin d'air libérant le gaz d'un générateur de gaz (X) inutilisé en appliquant un faisceau laser YAG (R) sur un allumeur (P) du générateur de gaz (X).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>